### Set Estate Pay Rate
POST http://localhost:3000/payroll/rates
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_OR_OWNER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estateId": "<ESTATE_UUID>",
  "rate": 15.50,
  "unit": "kg",
  "paymentFactor": 1.0,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-10-01"
}

### Generate Payroll for Owner Period
POST http://localhost:3000/payroll/generate
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_OR_OWNER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "<OWNER_UUID>",
  "periodStart": "2026-10-01",
  "periodEnd": "2026-10-31",
  "paymentFrequency": "monthly"
}

### Get All Payrolls
GET http://localhost:3000/payroll
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_OR_OWNER_TOKEN>

### Process Payroll
PATCH http://localhost:3000/payroll/<PAYROLL_UUID>/process
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_OR_OWNER_TOKEN>

### Record Payment for Payroll Item
POST http://localhost:3000/payroll/payments
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_OR_OWNER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payrollItemId": "<PAYROLL_ITEM_UUID>",
  "amount": 25400.00,
  "paymentDate": "2026-10-24T10:00:00Z",
  "bankName": "Bank of Ceylon",
  "accountNumber": "123456789",
  "accountName": "S. Perera",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-20261024-9981"
}
